## 1. Currency ranking

Composite is the weighted pillar score on the -3 to +3 band. Dispersion is the
spread across pillars: high dispersion means the pillars disagree and conviction
should be cut. Coverage is the fraction of pillar weight that had usable data.

| # | CCY | Composite | Dispersion | Coverage |{% for pillar in pillar_order %} {{ pillar.value[:4] }} |{% endfor %}
|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|{% for pillar in pillar_order %}---:|{% endfor %}
