   the same figure would read 79% in the terminal. #}
| {{ score.rank }} | {{ score.currency }} | {{ '%+.2f' | format(score.composite) }} | {{ '%.2f' | format(score.dispersion) }} | {{ (score.coverage * 100) | int }}% |
